.TH SESSIONSIFU 1 "September 2026" "SessionSifu 3.5.20" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sessionsifu \- save and restore desktop sessions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sessionsifu
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
SessionSifu records running applications, open documents and supported window
layout information.  It can restore named sessions and recent automatic
snapshots through its graphical manager or GNOME Shell integration.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR --save " " NAME
Save the current desktop as a named session.
.TP
.BR --restore " " NAME
Restore a named session.
.TP
.B --list
List saved sessions.
.TP
.B --version
Print the installed version.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/sessionsifu/
User settings and saved session metadata.
.SH SEE ALSO
Project documentation is installed under
.IR /usr/share/doc/sessionsifu/ .
.SH BUGS
Report issues at https://github.com/tpluharik/SessionSifu/issues.
